    "# Gemma 4 12B trait vectors — rated by GPT-5.6 Luna (OpenRouter)\n",
    "\n",
    "Eight contrastive directions out of `google/gemma-4-12B-it`:\n",
    "factual/hallucinatory, serious/funny, casual/formal, creative/empirical,\n",
    "honest/sycophantic, confident/unsure, empathetic/unempathetic, calm/anxious.\n",
    "\n",
    "`v = mean(first pole) − mean(second pole)`. First label is always the positive direction.\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT-5.6 Luna is the only rater. It sees a blinded packet — rubric, user message,\n",
    "response, plus the reference or expected answer where one exists. Never the\n",
    "system prompt, the intended pole, or the intended label.\n",
    "\n",
    "Order: smoke → pilot → rate → filter → extract → pick layers → held-out test → save → steer.\n",
    "Checkpointed after every expensive stage, so a disconnect doesn't cost the run."
   ]
  },
