    "## 7. Layer selection (grouped)\n",
    "\n",
    "A random row split leaks — each situation appears under several system prompts and both\n",
    "poles. So: hold out 20% of `situation_id` groups untouched, GroupKFold the remaining 80%,\n",
    "take `mean(first pole) − mean(second pole)` inside each training fold, and score the\n",
    "held-out groups by ROC-AUC on the projection.\n",
    "\n",
    "Yields both a per-trait best layer and one shared layer maximizing mean AUC across traits —\n",
    "the shared one matters for a dashboard, where all eight vectors read from a single layer."
   ]
