    "- ≥ 2/3 sign agreement when repeat passes are on\n",
    "- no obvious lexical shortcut in error analysis\n",
    "- steering moves the rated trait without wrecking coherence\n",
    "\n",
    "All of this measures consistency with one evaluator. None of it establishes psychological\n",
