    "## 9. Score a completed response\n",
    "\n",
    "Re-encodes system prompt + user prompt + response, averages the selected layer over the\n",
    "response tokens, and returns the raw projection, a z-score against the training midpoint\n",
    "and scale, and the calibrated first-pole probability.\n",
    "\n",
    "Use a package built from the same model revision and activation context."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "0af7ce0c",
   "metadata": {},
