    "## 12. Lexical-shortcut and entanglement checks\n",
    "\n",
    "A vector can look accurate while really detecting \"maybe\", \"sorry\", or \"joke\". Worth running:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. hold an entire system-prompt pair out of vector construction\n",
    "2. paraphrase the prompts without trait words\n",
    "3. balance topics across both poles\n",
    "4. counterfactual wording — empathy without \"sorry\", hedging without \"maybe\"\n",
    "5. evaluate every vector against every other trait's test examples\n",
    "6. re-extract with `ACTIVATION_CONTEXT = \"neutral\"`\n",
    "7. confirm steering one vector doesn't drag unrelated traits\n",
    "\n",
    "Per-trait best layers differ, so only compare cosine similarity within the shared layer."
   ]
